     "explanation": "The mechanism Nestor presents is developmental and mechanical, not genetic: bone, including the palate, remodels in response to the forces placed on it during growth. Repeated chewing force from fibrous, tough foods loads the palate and stimulates wider growth, leaving room for teeth and a roomier nasal airway. A soft, low-effort diet removes that mechanical stimulus, and the palate develops narrower.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mechanism Check</text><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"330\" r=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Chewing Force</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">on Growing Bone</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"490\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M530 550 L550 580 L570 550\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"600\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bone Remodels: Wider Palate</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">More room for teeth and airway</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not genetics. Not vitamins alone. Not diagnosis timing.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mechanical stimulus during development</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The correct mechanism is mechanical bone loading from chewing during the growth years, not genetics, a single vitamin, or diagnostic history."
     }
